  "overview": "**Tailwind CSS** is a light-first design system anchored on `#fbfbf9` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.0:1 contrast) and `#fe9a00` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `System UI` (16px display down to 16px body), unified by `8px` base corner radius and stepped `#fbfbf9` -> `#f0f9ff` surface layering.\n\nMaintained by **Tailwind Labs**. Source: published token package (https://tailwindcss.com), package `tailwindcss`. Inventory: **91** colors, **3** typography steps, and **8** documented components (MIT license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 8 component tokens with documented paddings: `8px 12px`, `2px`, `6px 12px`, `12px 14px`, `10px 14px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#f0f9ff` cards; separate sibling sections using `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Surface & Stroke Elevation**: Relies on crisp tonal contrast (`#fbfbf9` -> `#f0f9ff`) and `1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines instead of heavy drop shadows.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#fe9a00` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#fbfbf9` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#fe9a00` with `#0b0b0c` text (9.2:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `System UI` headings with `System UI` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `8px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (8px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#f0f9ff` surface shifts and `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `8px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
